# Complete Design System Architecture

## Baby Pink × Google Sans Flex

---

## 1. Typography System

### 1.1 Foundation

**Base Size:** 16px (1rem)  
**Font Family:** Google Sans Flex, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif

**Core Principle:** Use the base size for most UI elements. Only scale in ±2px increments when hierarchy absolutely requires it.

### 1.2 Type Scale

| Token | Size | rem | Use Case |
|-------|------|-----|----------|
| `text-xs` | 12px | 0.75rem | Captions, timestamps, metadata |
| `text-sm` | 14px | 0.875rem | Secondary text, labels, helper text |
| `text-base` | 16px | 1rem | Body text, UI elements (PRIMARY) |
| `text-lg` | 18px | 1.125rem | Emphasized body, card titles |
| `text-xl` | 20px | 1.25rem | Section headings |
| `text-2xl` | 24px | 1.5rem | Page headings |
| `text-3xl` | 30px | 1.875rem | Hero titles (use sparingly) |

### 1.3 Weight Scale

| Token | Weight | Use Case |
|-------|--------|----------|
| `font-normal` | 400 | Body text, descriptions |
| `font-medium` | 500 | UI elements, emphasized text |
| `font-semibold` | 600 | Subheadings, active states |
| `font-bold` | 700 | Primary headings, CTAs |

### 1.4 Line Height System

| Token | Value | Use Case |
|-------|-------|----------|
| `leading-tight` | 1.25 | Large headings, display text |
| `leading-snug` | 1.375 | Small headings, card titles |
| `leading-normal` | 1.5 | Body text (default) |
| `leading-relaxed` | 1.625 | Long-form content |

#### Key Insight: Line-height acts as built-in bottom margin. Titles naturally "stand alone" through their line-height creating separation

### 1.5 Component Typography Specifications

#### Buttons

- **Primary CTA:** `text-base` / `font-semibold` / `leading-normal`
- **Secondary:** `text-sm` / `font-medium` / `leading-normal`
- **Text Button:** `text-sm` / `font-medium` / `leading-normal`

#### Navigation

- **Nav Item:** `text-base` / `font-medium` / `leading-normal`
- **Active Nav:** `text-base` / `font-semibold` / `leading-normal`
- **Subnav:** `text-sm` / `font-normal` / `leading-normal`

#### Cards

- **Card Title:** `text-lg` / `font-semibold` / `leading-snug`
- **Card Description:** `text-base` / `font-normal` / `leading-normal`
- **Card Metadata:** `text-sm` / `font-normal` / lightness reduced

#### Forms

- **Input Text:** `text-base` / `font-normal` / `leading-normal`
- **Label:** `text-sm` / `font-medium` / `leading-normal`
- **Helper Text:** `text-xs` / `font-normal` / lightness reduced
- **Error Text:** `text-xs` / `font-medium` / semantic red

#### Headings

- **H1:** `text-2xl` / `font-bold` / `leading-tight`
- **H2:** `text-xl` / `font-semibold` / `leading-snug`
- **H3:** `text-lg` / `font-semibold` / `leading-snug`
- **H4:** `text-base` / `font-semibold` / `leading-normal`

#### Content

- **Body Text:** `text-base` / `font-normal` / `leading-normal`
- **Small Print:** `text-sm` / `font-normal` / `leading-normal`
- **Caption:** `text-xs` / `font-normal` / `leading-normal`

### 1.6 Hierarchy Through Size + Weight + Color

**Don't rely on size alone.** Combine three properties:

1. **Size** - Minimal variation (±2px)
2. **Weight** - 400 (normal) → 500 (medium) → 600 (semibold) → 700 (bold)
3. **Color/Lightness** - High contrast (important) → reduced lightness (secondary)

#### Pattern Example

```text
Title: text-lg + font-semibold + 100% lightness
Body: text-base + font-normal + 70% lightness
Metadata: text-sm + font-normal + 55% lightness
```

