## 2. Dark Mode Color System

### 2.1 Neutral Palette (HSL)

**Construction:** Hue = 0, Saturation = 0, vary Lightness

| Token | HSL | OKLCH | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|-------|
| `bg-darkest` | `hsl(0, 0%, 0%)` | `oklch(0% 0 0)` | Base background |
| `bg-dark` | `hsl(0, 0%, 5%)` | `oklch(20% 0 0)` | Card backgrounds |
| `bg-mid` | `hsl(0, 0%, 10%)` | `oklch(30% 0 0)` | Elevated surfaces |
| `bg-light` | `hsl(0, 0%, 15%)` | `oklch(37% 0 0)` | Highest elevation |
| `border-subtle` | `hsl(0, 0%, 20%)` | `oklch(42% 0 0)` | Dividers, borders |
| `border-default` | `hsl(0, 0%, 30%)` | `oklch(52% 0 0)` | Input borders |
| `text-muted` | `hsl(0, 0%, 55%)` | `oklch(60% 0 0)` | Secondary text |
| `text-default` | `hsl(0, 0%, 70%)` | `oklch(74% 0 0)` | Body text |
| `text-emphasis` | `hsl(0, 0%, 90%)` | `oklch(92% 0 0)` | Headings, emphasis |
| `highlight` | `hsl(0, 0%, 25%)` | `oklch(47% 0 0)` | Top border highlight |

**Key Principle:** Lighter = elevated = more important

### 2.2 Brand Color: Baby Pink

**Primary Pink:**

- **Base:** `hsl(340, 82%, 85%)` / `oklch(87% 0.11 345)`
- **Hover:** `hsl(340, 82%, 80%)` / `oklch(84% 0.11 345)`
- **Active:** `hsl(340, 82%, 75%)` / `oklch(81% 0.11 345)`
- **Subtle:** `hsl(340, 82%, 20%)` / `oklch(42% 0.11 345)` - for dark mode backgrounds

**Pink Variations for UI:**

| Token | HSL | OKLCH | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|-------|
| `pink-bg-subtle` | `hsl(340, 82%, 15%)` | `oklch(35% 0.11 345)` | Hover states on dark |
| `pink-bg-muted` | `hsl(340, 82%, 20%)` | `oklch(42% 0.11 345)` | Selected state background |
| `pink-border` | `hsl(340, 82%, 45%)` | `oklch(62% 0.11 345)` | Focus rings, borders |
| `pink-default` | `hsl(340, 82%, 65%)` | `oklch(75% 0.11 345)` | Icons, accents |
| `pink-emphasis` | `hsl(340, 82%, 85%)` | `oklch(87% 0.11 345)` | Primary buttons, links |
| `pink-text-on-pink` | `hsl(340, 82%, 12%)` | `oklch(30% 0.11 345)` | Text on pink buttons |

### 2.3 Semantic Colors (Dark Mode)

**Success (Green):**

- Base: `hsl(145, 65%, 60%)` / `oklch(72% 0.14 145)`
- Background: `hsl(145, 65%, 15%)` / `oklch(35% 0.14 145)`

**Danger (Red):**

- Base: `hsl(0, 75%, 65%)` / `oklch(67% 0.18 25)`
- Background: `hsl(0, 75%, 15%)` / `oklch(35% 0.18 25)`

**Warning (Amber):**

- Base: `hsl(45, 90%, 65%)` / `oklch(78% 0.14 85)`
- Background: `hsl(45, 90%, 20%)` / `oklch(45% 0.14 85)`

**Info (Blue):**

- Base: `hsl(210, 80%, 65%)` / `oklch(72% 0.13 245)`
- Background: `hsl(210, 80%, 15%)` / `oklch(35% 0.13 245)`

### 2.4 Gradients, Borders & Shadows (Dark Mode)

**Subtle Gradient:**

```css
background: linear-gradient(180deg, 
  hsl(0, 0%, 10%) 0%, 
  hsl(0, 0%, 5%) 100%
);
```

**Hover Gradient:**

```css
background: linear-gradient(180deg, 
  hsl(0, 0%, 15%) 0%, 
  hsl(0, 0%, 8%) 100%
);
```

**Pink Accent Gradient:**

```css
background: linear-gradient(135deg, 
  hsl(340, 82%, 20%) 0%, 
  hsl(340, 82%, 12%) 100%
);
```

**Border with Highlight:**

```css
border: 1px solid hsl(0, 0%, 20%);
border-top: 1px solid hsl(0, 0%, 25%); /* highlight */
```

**Multi-layer Shadow:**

```css
box-shadow: 
  0 1px 3px hsla(0, 0%, 0%, 0.5),
  0 4px 12px hsla(0, 0%, 0%, 0.3);
```

