## 7. How to Use This System in Production

### 7.1 Setup Process

#### Step 1: Install Font

```html
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Google+Sans+Flex:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
```

#### Step 2: Copy CSS Variables

- Copy the entire `:root` section to your main CSS file
- Add `.light` or `@media (prefers-color-scheme: light)` overrides
- Or use framework-specific implementation (see below)

#### Step 3: Theme Switching

```javascript
// Simple toggle
document.body.classList.toggle('light');

// With localStorage persistence
const theme = localStorage.getItem('theme') || 'dark';
document.body.classList.add(theme);

function toggleTheme() {
  const current = document.body.classList.contains('light') ? 'light' : 'dark';
  const next = current === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';
  document.body.classList.remove(current);
  document.body.classList.add(next);
  localStorage.setItem('theme', next);
}
```

