**React (Next.js/Vite):**

```jsx
// ThemeProvider.jsx
import { createContext, useContext, useEffect, useState } from 'react';

const ThemeContext = createContext();

export function ThemeProvider({ children }) {
  const [theme, setTheme] = useState('dark');

  useEffect(() => {
    const saved = localStorage.getItem('theme') || 'dark';
    setTheme(saved);
    document.documentElement.classList.toggle('light', saved === 'light');
  }, []);

  const toggleTheme = () => {
    const newTheme = theme === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';
    setTheme(newTheme);
    localStorage.setItem('theme', newTheme);
    document.documentElement.classList.toggle('light', newTheme === 'light');
  };

  return (
    <ThemeContext.Provider value={{ theme, toggleTheme }}>
      {children}
    </ThemeContext.Provider>
  );
}

export const useTheme = () => useContext(ThemeContext);
```

**Vue.js:**

```javascript
// useTheme.js
import { ref, onMounted, watch } from 'vue';

export function useTheme() {
  const theme = ref('dark');

  const toggleTheme = () => {
    theme.value = theme.value === 'dark' ? 'light' : 'dark';
    localStorage.setItem('theme', theme.value);
    document.documentElement.classList.toggle('light', theme.value === 'light');
  };

  onMounted(() => {
    const saved = localStorage.getItem('theme') || 'dark';
    theme.value = saved;
    document.documentElement.classList.toggle('light', saved === 'light');
  });

  return { theme, toggleTheme };
}
```

### 7.3 Design Best Practices

**DO:**

- ✅ Use base size (16px) for 90% of your UI
- ✅ Combine size + weight + color for hierarchy
- ✅ Let line-height create natural spacing
- ✅ Use lighter colors for elevated surfaces
- ✅ Keep borders subtle and blend them
- ✅ Use baby pink for primary actions and accents
- ✅ Test both dark and light modes during design
- ✅ Ensure text contrast meets WCAG AA standards (4.5:1 minimum)

**DON'T:**

- ❌ Create more than 5-7 font sizes
- ❌ Rely only on size for hierarchy
- ❌ Use pure white (100%) for body text in dark mode (too harsh)
- ❌ Use pure black (0%) for text in light mode (too harsh)
- ❌ Add manual margins when line-height does it automatically
- ❌ Make everything baby pink (use it as an accent)
- ❌ Use different border colors for top/bottom unless intentional highlight
- ❌ Forget to test with user-scaled fonts (use rem units)

### 7.4 Common Patterns

#### Pattern 1: Card with Hierarchy

```html
<div class="card">
  <h3 class="card__title">New Feature Released</h3>
  <p class="card__description">
    We've added dark mode support with automatic theme detection 
    based on system preferences.
  </p>
  <span class="card__meta">2 hours ago</span>
</div>
```

- Title: Large + semibold + high contrast
- Description: Base + normal + medium contrast  
- Meta: Small + normal + low contrast

#### Pattern 2: Button Hierarchy

```html
<div class="button-group">
  <button class="btn-primary">Save Changes</button>
  <button class="btn-secondary">Cancel</button>
</div>
```

- Primary: Pink background + bold weight
- Secondary: Transparent + medium weight + pink text

#### Pattern 3: Form with Labels

```html
<div class="form-field">
  <label class="input__label" for="email">Email Address</label>
  <input class="input" id="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com">
  <span class="input__helper">We'll never share your email</span>
</div>
```

- Label: Small + medium weight + high contrast
- Input: Base + normal weight
- Helper: Extra small + normal + low contrast

#### Pattern 4: Navigation States

```html
<nav class="nav">
  <a href="/" class="nav-item nav-item--active">Dashboard</a>
  <a href="/projects" class="nav-item">Projects</a>
  <a href="/settings" class="nav-item">Settings</a>
</nav>
```

- Active: Semibold + pink color + pink background
- Inactive: Medium weight + default text color
- Hover: Background transition

### 7.5 Accessibility Checklist

**Color Contrast:**

- ✅ Text on `bg-darkest`: Use `text-default` (70% lightness) or higher
- ✅ Text on `bg-dark`: Use `text-emphasis` (90% lightness) for headings
- ✅ Small text (< 14px): Requires 4.5:1 contrast minimum
- ✅ Large text (≥ 18px): Requires 3:1 contrast minimum
- ✅ Interactive elements: 3:1 contrast minimum

**Typography:**

- ✅ Use rem units for all font sizes (respects user preferences)
- ✅ Minimum font size: 12px (0.75rem) for UI text
- ✅ Line-height: At least 1.5 for body text
- ✅ Line length: 45-75 characters for optimal readability

**Interaction:**

- ✅ Focus states visible with pink border + subtle background
- ✅ Touch targets: Minimum 44×44px for mobile
- ✅ Hover states: Clear visual feedback
- ✅ Color never the only indicator (use icons/text too)

### 7.6 Responsive Typography

**Mobile (< 640px):**

```css
@media (max-width: 639px) {
  :root {
    --text-2xl: 1.25rem;  /* Reduce from 1.5rem */
    --text-3xl: 1.5rem;   /* Reduce from 1.875rem */
  }
}
```

**Tablet (640px - 1024px):**

- Use default scale (works well at all sizes)

**Desktop (> 1024px):**

- Consider increasing base to 18px for better readability
- Or maintain 16px and use more whitespace

### 7.7 Performance Tips

**Font Loading:**

```html
<!-- Preload critical font weights -->
<link rel="preload" 
      href="/fonts/GoogleSansFlex-Regular.woff2" 
      as="font" 
      type="font/woff2" 
      crossorigin>

<!-- Use font-display for better UX -->
<style>
@font-face {
  font-family: 'Google Sans Flex';
  src: url('/fonts/GoogleSansFlex-Regular.woff2') format('woff2');
  font-weight: 400;
  font-display: swap; /* Prevents invisible text */
}
</style>
```

**CSS Variables:**

```css
/* Reduce paint by using transform instead of properties that trigger layout */
.btn-primary:hover {
  transform: translateY(-1px); /* ✅ Good - only composite */
  /* top: -1px; ❌ Bad - triggers layout */
}
```

### 7.8 Theme Switching Best Practices

**Prevent Flash of Unstyled Content:**

```html
<!-- Add to <head> before any styles -->
<script>
  // Runs before page renders
  (function() {
    const theme = localStorage.getItem('theme') || 'dark';
    document.documentElement.classList.add(theme === 'light' ? 'light' : 'dark');
  })();
</script>
```

**Smooth Transitions:**

```css
/* Add to body or root element */
.theme-transition * {
  transition: background-color 0.3s ease, 
              color 0.3s ease, 
              border-color 0.3s ease !important;
}

/* Apply class during theme switch, remove after transition */
```

**Respect System Preferences:**

```javascript
// Listen for system theme changes
window.matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: light)')
  .addEventListener('change', e => {
    const systemTheme = e.matches ? 'light' : 'dark';
    // Only apply if user hasn't set preference
    if (!localStorage.getItem('theme')) {
      setTheme(systemTheme);
    }
  });
```

