## 9. Migration Guide

### 9.1 From Existing Design System

#### Step 1: Audit Current System

- List all font sizes currently in use
- Identify which can be consolidated
- Map to new scale (likely 90% can use base size)

#### Step 2: Color Mapping

```text
Your Current → New System
--------------------------------
Primary Blue → pink-emphasis
Secondary Gray → text-default
Background → bg-darkest
Card BG → bg-dark
Border → border-subtle
```

#### Step 3: Component Migration

- Start with buttons (highest visibility)
- Move to cards and forms
- Finish with navigation and utilities
- Test accessibility after each phase

#### Step 4: Gradual Rollout

```css
/* Phase 1: Add new variables alongside old */
:root {
  /* Old variables (deprecated) */
  --color-primary: #FF69B4;
  
  /* New system */
  --pink-emphasis: oklch(87% 0.11 345);
}

/* Phase 2: Update components one by one */
/* Phase 3: Remove old variables */
```

