### 10.5 Getting Help

**Common Issues:**

**"Text looks blurry on Windows"**
→ Add `-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;` and `text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;`

**"Colors look different in Safari"**
→ OKLCH renders slightly differently; test in actual browser, not design tools

**"Light mode borders invisible"**
→ Ensure borders don't match surface colors; use `border-subtle` token

**"Font weights not working"**
→ Verify all weights imported from Google Fonts (400, 500, 600, 700)

**"Theme flash on page load"**
→ Add theme detection script in `<head>` before stylesheets

